1
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:39,000
Still armed. Still dangerous. Still got it.

2
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:12,000
RED is a action, adventure, comedy film directed by Robert Schwentke.

3
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:45,000
After surviving an assault from a squad of hit men, retired CIA black ops
agent Frank Moses reassembles his old team for an all-out war.

4
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:18,000
Frank reunites with old Joe, crazy Marvin and wily Victoria to
uncover a massive conspiracy that threatens their lives.

5
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:51,000
Only their expert training will allow them to survive a
near-impossible mission -- breaking into CIA headquarters.

6
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:24,000
Frank Moses, played by Bruce Willis.

7
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:57,000
Marvin Boggs, played by John Malkovich.

8
00:44:24,000 --> 00:44:30,000
Joe Matheson, played by Morgan Freeman.

9
00:49:57,000 --> 00:50:03,000
Victoria, played by Helen Mirren.

10
00:55:30,000 --> 00:55:36,000
Sarah Ross, played by Mary-Louise Parker.

11
01:01:03,000 --> 01:01:09,000
William Cooper, played by Karl Urban.

12
01:06:36,000 --> 01:06:42,000
Red is a 2010 American action comedy film directed by Robert Schwentke, based
on the comic book series by Warren Ellis and Cully Hamner.

13
01:12:09,000 --> 01:12:15,000
The film stars Bruce Willis, Morgan Freeman, John Malkovich, Helen Mirren, Karl Urban,
Mary-Louise Parker, Brian Cox, Julian McMahon and Richard Dreyfuss.

14
01:17:42,000 --> 01:17:48,000
The plot involves Frank Moses, a former black-ops agent who reunites with his
old team to capture an assassin who has vowed to kill him.

15
01:23:15,000 --> 01:23:21,000
Red premiered at the Fantastic Fest on September 29, 2010, and was released
in the United States on October 15, by Summit Entertainment.

16
01:28:48,000 --> 01:28:54,000
The film received generally positive reviews from critics and was nominated for Best
Motion Picture – Musical or Comedy at the 68th Golden Globe Awards.

17
01:34:21,000 --> 01:34:27,000
A sequel, Red 2, was released in 2013.

18
01:39:54,000 --> 01:40:00,000
The film explores themes of assassin, central intelligence agency
(cia), undercover agent, kidnapping, assault rifle.

19
01:45:27,000 --> 01:45:33,000
The tone is lighthearted and intense.
